==German==

===Etymology===
An originally [[Low German|Low]] and [[Central German]] word from {{bor|de|gml|nütlik|nǖtlīk|delicious, delicate}} and [[Central Franconian]] {{inh|de|gmh|nītlīche}}, late Central {{der|de|gmh|niethlīchen||eagerly}}. It is then from {{der|de|osx|niudlīko||eagerly}} (compare {{cog|ang|nēodlīċe}}), derived from {{der|de|osx|niud}}, from {{der|de|gem-pro|*neudaz||desire, drive, urge}}, equivalent to {{suffix|de|nied|lich}}. More at {{cog|en|needly}}.

